  "form_version": "",
  "use_relationship": "The Training Device Interim Support Report (TDISR) will be used to document contractor support provided during interim periods such as Contractor Field Support (CFS), Interim Contractor Support (ICS) or Contractor Logistics Support (CLS) that are included in a training device delivery order as a limited support period used to transfer support responsibility to long term support constructs.\n\nData documented includes maintenance data to predict future requirements, part failure data, part relationship to the training device, contractor's time distribution, work accomplished, on-the-job training provided, technical data provided and relationship of support to delivered technical data package.\n\nThis Data Item Description (DID) contains the format, content, and intended use information for the data deliverable resulting from the work task described in the contract.\n\nThis DID supersedes DI-MGMT-81997.",
